      "writtenOn": "2023-11-09T18:17:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "codecType is currently a strict enum, with values encoding a static number of codecs. That model is not compatible with codec extensability where unknown codecs may be supported by the HAL provider.\n\nThis class aims to abstract the codec type, and enable unknown codecs in the code.",
